<title>USA: INTERVIEW - Dove CEO sees return to profit.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW - Dove CEO sees return to profit.</headline>
<byline>Lisa Marie Pane</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dove Entertainment Inc President and Chief Executive Michael Viner said the company expects to slash costs by 10 percent in 1997 and consolidate operations, a move which should return the company to profitability.</p>
<p>&quot;We bit off a lot in terms of expansion and now we need to consolidate it,&quot; he said in an interview on Thursday. &quot;The blueprint is there. But getting it to work smoothly will take a few months.&quot;</p>
</text>
